pi-pstack
=========

This package is a native Pi coding-agent port of the Cursor plugin "pstack"
(https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack), originally authored by
Lauren Tan (poteto). Upstream license: MIT. Upstream cache used for this port:
pstack v0.15.2.

Philosophy, playbooks, and principle skills are preserved. Platform bindings
(Task / subagent_type / Cursor paths) are rewritten for Pi:

  pstack_spawn, pstack_swarm, pstack_arena, pstack_loop, pstack_decision_log,
  pstack_worktree, pstack_deslop, pstack_control_cli, pstack_control_ui,
  pstack_sessions, pstack_ship, pstack_babysit, pstack_benny_wake

Built against official Pi package/extension APIs (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent).

Physical impossibilities only (closest twins shipped — see PARITY.md):
  - Cursor plugin marketplace (.cursor-plugin) → package.json `pi` manifest
  - Cursor cloud agent VMs → local pstack_spawn + pstack_worktree
  - Cursor Automations Slack bus → pstack_benny_wake + pstack_loop + Benny skills
  - Full Electron/IDE control-ui → pstack_control_ui HTTP probe + browser MCP
  - Grok Bot update_state cards → make-bot-ui wake file / webhook twin
